  <object id="100" template="../../../../common/maps/obj/enemy.tx" gid="2147495067" x="131.804" y="209.816">
   <properties>
    <property name="dialog">[
  {
    &quot;text&quot;: &quot;The Warden stands among Orazca's new roofs, the old map under his arm. \&quot;A town again,\&quot; he says. \&quot;Not yet the heart of the realm - stone and coin will make it that, when you have enough of both.\&quot;&quot;,
    &quot;options&quot;: [
      {
        &quot;name&quot;: &quot;(Leave)&quot;
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    &quot;condition&quot;: [
      {
        &quot;getQuestFlag&quot;: {
          &quot;key&quot;: &quot;mainQuest&quot;,
          &quot;op&quot;: &quot;&gt;=&quot;,
          &quot;val&quot;: 1
        }
      },
      {
        &quot;checkQuestFlag&quot;: &quot;wardenOrazca&quot;,
        &quot;not&quot;: true
      }
    ],
    &quot;text&quot;: &quot;\&quot;You found it, then - and put roofs back on it before I could tell you how.\&quot; The Warden sets a hand on a new doorpost. \&quot;Orazca. Your seat, before the Night of Chains. The rest will not come back as easily.\&quot;&quot;,
    &quot;options&quot;: [
      {
        &quot;name&quot;: &quot;\&quot;Where do I start?\&quot;&quot;,
        &quot;text&quot;: &quot;\&quot;With the five who owe you. Benalia, Tolaria, Urborg, Shiv, Llanowar - the Ring Cities whose councils cracked your prison. Every one of them pledged you a gift and none have paid it. Walk the Ring, Guardian, collect what is owed, and come back able to build.\&quot;&quot;,
        &quot;options&quot;: [
          {
            &quot;name&quot;: &quot;(Walk the Ring)&quot;,
            &quot;action&quot;: [
              {
                &quot;setQuestFlag&quot;: {
                  &quot;key&quot;: &quot;wardenOrazca&quot;,
                  &quot;val&quot;: 1
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    &quot;condition&quot;: [
      {
        &quot;checkQuestFlag&quot;: &quot;Ch1CastlesComplete&quot;,
        &quot;getQuestFlag&quot;: {
          &quot;key&quot;: &quot;Ch1CastlesComplete&quot;,
          &quot;op&quot;: &quot;&lt;&quot;,
          &quot;val&quot;: 5
        }
      }
    ],
    &quot;text&quot;: &quot;\&quot;{var=player_name}! I feel the Seals stirring - every throne you break gives a piece of you back. Break them all, Guardian.\&quot;&quot;,
    &quot;options&quot;: [
      {
        &quot;name&quot;: &quot;\&quot;Goodbye.\&quot;&quot;
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    &quot;condition&quot;: [
      {
        &quot;getQuestFlag&quot;: {
          &quot;key&quot;: &quot;Ch1CastlesComplete&quot;,
          &quot;op&quot;: &quot;&gt;=&quot;,
          &quot;val&quot;: 5
        }
      },
      {
        &quot;getQuestFlag&quot;: {
          &quot;key&quot;: &quot;mainQuest&quot;,
          &quot;op&quot;: &quot;&lt;&quot;,
          &quot;val&quot;: 3
        }
      }
    ],
    &quot;text&quot;: &quot;\&quot;Orazca stands, and the five thrones are broken. Welcome home, {var=player_name}.\&quot;&quot;,
    &quot;options&quot;: [
      {
        &quot;action&quot;: [
          {
            &quot;removeItem&quot;: &quot;&quot;,
            &quot;setColorIdentity&quot;: &quot;&quot;,
            &quot;advanceQuestFlag&quot;: &quot;&quot;,
            &quot;advanceMapFlag&quot;: &quot;&quot;,
            &quot;setQuestFlag&quot;: {
              &quot;key&quot;: &quot;mainQuest&quot;,
              &quot;val&quot;: 3
            },
            &quot;setMapFlag&quot;: {
              &quot;key&quot;: &quot;&quot;
            },
            &quot;issueQuest&quot;: &quot;&quot;,
            &quot;POIReference&quot;: &quot;&quot;
          }
        ],
        &quot;name&quot;: &quot;\&quot;The five castles have fallen. The Seals are mine again.\&quot;&quot;,
        &quot;text&quot;: &quot;\&quot;Then it is done - what was stolen is restored. But hear an old man's last warning: the Five did not invent your prison. They found its design.\&quot;&quot;,
        &quot;options&quot;: [
          {
            &quot;name&quot;: &quot;\&quot;Found it... where?\&quot;&quot;,
            &quot;text&quot;: &quot;\&quot;Beneath this realm there are older doors, Guardian - older than my order, older than your wardenship. Your Seals were never only bindings. They were also locks.\&quot;&quot;,
            &quot;options&quot;: [
              {
                &quot;name&quot;: &quot;(Continue)&quot;,
                &quot;text&quot;: &quot;\&quot;Now those locks sit in your pocket instead of on the doors - and whatever slept behind them has had three thousand years to grow hungry. Rest. Rebuild. And keep your deck close, Guardian.\&quot;&quot;,
                &quot;options&quot;: [
                  {
                    &quot;name&quot;: &quot;(Continue)&quot;,
                    &quot;text&quot;: &quot;[RED]Developer's note:[] You have reached the end of The Forsaken Realms' current story content - but the realm fights on: territory, research, restoration and the Five continue. Several difficult dungeons have also been added to your world map.&quot;,
                    &quot;options&quot;: [
                      {
                        &quot;name&quot;: &quot;(Continue)&quot;,
                        &quot;text&quot;: &quot;[RED]Developer's note:[] Watch for the next release to continue the story - and thanks for coming on this Adventure with us!&quot;,
                        &quot;options&quot;: [
                          {
                            &quot;name&quot;: &quot;(Chapter 1 complete)&quot;
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    &quot;condition&quot;: [
      {
        &quot;item&quot;: &quot;Blue Key&quot;
      },
      {
        &quot;item&quot;: &quot;Green Key&quot;
